# MUZZLE SMOKE: the pale smoke a cannon's shot leaves at the barrel's mouth (with muzzle_flash.pfx; one puff,
# GameProjectileComponent::spawn). Lit grey smoke that rolls out, swells and rises slowly. Not additive: it stays smoke;
# an emissive floor keeps it readable at night.
ParticleEffect MuzzleSmoke
	Emitter Smoke
		Texture Textures/Particles/smoke_puff.dds
		Rate 0
		Burst 8
		SpawnRadius 0.3
		Offset 0, 0, 0
		ConeAngle 180
		Speed 0.6 2.0
		Life 1.2 2.4
		Gravity -0.8
		Drag 1.6
		Turbulence 1.2 0.6 0.4
		Size 0.6 2.0
		SizeVariance 0.35
		ColorStart 0.45, 0.47, 0.5, 0.7
		ColorEnd 0.3, 0.32, 0.35, 0
		Additivity 0
		Lit true
		EmissiveFloor 0.25
		FadeIn 0.05
		FadeOutStart 0.35
		SoftFade 0.4
		Spin 0.8
